        {"id":"dropcap-demo","type":"paragraph","style":"body","text":"首字下沉适用于专题文章的开篇段落。它仍然是普通结构化正文，只通过 publishing.dropCap 控制版面表现。","publishing":{"dropCap":true,"keepWithNext":false}},
        {"id":"sidebar-demo","type":"sidebar","title":"SIDEBAR","text":"侧栏被视为不可轻易拆开的出版对象，可用于政策解释、延伸阅读、数据摘要和编辑提示。","publishing":{"role":"sidebar","avoidBreak":true}},
        {"id":"quote-demo","type":"pullQuote","label":"EDITORIAL NOTE","text":"跨栏重点引语能够打断长文节奏，建立清晰的视觉停顿。","publishing":{"spanAll":true,"role":"pullQuote"}},
        {"id":"section-demo","type":"sectionHeading","level":3,"text":"跨栏标题重新开启下一节","publishing":{"spanAll":true,"keepWithNext":true}},
        {"id":"body-demo","type":"paragraph","style":"body","text":"Alpha23 同时为图片左右环绕与 Caption 建立 publishing 语义。实际图片仍沿用现有 image block，只需要在右侧出版属性里选择左环绕或右环绕，即可参与正文流式布局。"}
      ]
